          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```txt\n/* Umwandlung von Fahrenheit in Celsius\n    fuer fahr = 0, 20, ..., 300   */\n\n    int fahr, celsius;\n    int lower,\n\n    lower = 0; // untere Grenze der Temperaturtabelle\n\n    fahr  = lower;\n    while (fahr <= upper)  {\n        celsius = 5  *  (fahr-32) / 9;\n\n        fahr = fahr + step;\n    }\n```",
