          "content": "```c\n#include <stdio.h>\n\n/* Umwandlung von Fahrenheit in Celsius\n    fuer fahr = 0, 20, ..., 300   */\nint main()\n{\n    int fahr, celsius;\n    int lower\n\n    lower = 0; // untere Grenze der Temperaturtabelle\n\n    fahr = lower;\n    while (fahr <= upper) {\n        celsius = 5 * (fahr-32) / 9;\n\n        fahr = fahr + step;\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
